[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8704.23, "timestamp": "02:25:04", "text": "伙计。 我打着石膏也没什么事。 我觉得我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8706.469, "timestamp": "02:25:06", "text": "不用再操心那些乱七八糟的东西了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8715.11, "timestamp": "02:25:15", "text": "我他妈的遇到了死神女士和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8722.309, "timestamp": "02:25:22", "text": "自行车先生。   那边那位是“是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8727.11, "timestamp": "02:25:27", "text": "啊先生”，还有“自行车先生”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8731.03, "timestamp": "02:25:31", "text": "我只需要我的脚轮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8733.99, "timestamp": "02:25:33", "text": "你没吸毒吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8738.309, "timestamp": "02:25:38", "text": "不，我没有吸毒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8740.87, "timestamp": "02:25:40", "text": "真的吗？ 我以为你已经走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8743.91, "timestamp": "02:25:43", "text": "哦不，它居然留了下来。 那间屋子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8758.95, "timestamp": "02:25:58", "text": "人，你这幸运的混蛋。"}]